
# Functions

## Borrow

A member borrows a book when both ids are valid.

- Inputs: member_id (nat), book_id (nat)
- Outputs: success (nat)
- Valid ids yield success 1; a zero book id yields success 0
- Decomposition: Library_Borrow

## member_registered

True when the given member id belongs to a registered member.

- Inputs: id (nat)
- Outputs: result (nat)

# Data Resources

## BookId

Natural-number identifier of a book.

## book_ids

Set of valid book identifiers shared by circulation processes.

# Constraints

## Positive book identifiers

forall[b: book_ids] | b > 0
